    "UI account revisions are originalCAS; private-denial/accountswitch/disposal clear records/drafts/sessions; session mutation preserves caller token binding through own private cleanup using unchanged ownerAccountApiClient",
    "Private route reset invalidates pendingnavigation and removes private adapters before ownerteardown; device-local Wave is retained as local, not anotheraccountgrant",
    "Native peer bridge excludes password values, rechecks current nativepeer visible/enabled/tree membership at action; snapshot cleared on privatecontext invalidation",
    "Serializer followup supplies sourcegenerated accessibility metadata and preserves actual canonicalreflection model assemblies; no altered canonicalmodel"
  ],
